    "h1": "HTS Chapter 32: Tanning or Dyeing Extracts; Tannins and Their Derivatives; Dyes, Pigments and Other Coloring Matter; Paints and Varnishes; Putty and Other Mastics; Inks — U.S. Exports & Foreign Tariffs",
    "seo": {
      "title": "U.S. Paint, Pigment & Ink Exports and Foreign Tariffs (HTS Ch. 32) | KoalaGains",
      "shortDescription": "U.S. exports of paints, titanium dioxide, dyes, caulk and printing ink were $7.78B in 2025, down 4.1%. Who buys them and which countries charge tariffs.",
